## Workflow

```
1. /restack-discover paths          map what is there; settle the boundary
2. /restack-discover actor <name>   investigate critical or opaque actors
3. /restack-discover intentions     trace key intentions end to end
4. /restack-discover gaps           prioritise what is still unknown
5. /restack-discover organisation   map resistance as stressors
6. /restack-discover confidence     CONFIDENCE GATE - not ready routes back to 1-5
   |
   v  ready
7. /restack-stressor walk           walk the discovered paths
```

**Parachuted into an unknown environment:** paths → actor → intentions → gaps,
and repeat until the gate passes. Expect several cycles; that is the terrain,
not a failure.

**When change is blocked:** go straight to `/restack-discover organisation`, translate
the resistance into stressors, and let residuals emerge that address the
organisational constraint alongside the technical ones.

